## What Problem This Solves

When copying auth profile credentials to a spawned child agent via `buildPortableAuthProfileSecretsStoreForAgentCopy`, the provider order configurations (`store.order`) were completely omitted. This wiped out any custom provider profile precedence in the spawned child agent's store, forcing it back to arbitrary defaults.

## Why This Change Was Made

Modified the secrets portable copy helper in `src/agents/auth-profiles/portability.ts` to copy over the `order` configuration property, ensuring that it is filtered so only the profile IDs being copied are retained.

## User Impact

Custom provider profile order and precedence are correctly preserved in spawned child agents, preventing configuration resets.

## Evidence

Added unit tests to `src/agents/auth-profiles/portability.test.ts` verifying:
- Precedence order is correctly preserved and filtered to copied profile IDs.
- Order is omitted when the input store has no order.
- Providers are entirely dropped from the order list if all their profile IDs were skipped/excluded.

All 7 tests passed successfully:
```
 ✓ |unit-fast| src/agents/auth-profiles/portability.test.ts (7 tests) 5ms
 Test Files  1 passed (1)
      Tests  7 passed (7)
```

### Real Behavior Proof

Running portable auth store copy shows the provider profile order is successfully preserved and mapped to the agent's auth config:
```json
=== Original Auth Profile Store ===
{
  "profiles": {
    "prof-1": {
      "id": "prof-1",
      "provider": "openai",
      "name": "OpenAI Primary"
    },
    "prof-2": {
      "id": "prof-2",
      "provider": "anthropic",
      "name": "Anthropic Backup"
    },
    "prof-3": {
      "id": "prof-3",
      "provider": "openai",
      "name": "OpenAI Sandbox"
    }
  },
  "order": {
    "openai": [
      "prof-3",
      "prof-1"
    ],
    "anthropic": [
      "prof-2"
    ]
  }
}
===================================
=== Portable Auth Profile Store for Agent Copy ===
{
  "store": {
    "version": 1,
    "profiles": {
      "prof-1": {
        "id": "prof-1",
        "provider": "openai",
        "name": "OpenAI Primary"
      },
      "prof-2": {
        "id": "prof-2",
        "provider": "anthropic",
        "name": "Anthropic Backup"
      },
      "prof-3": {
        "id": "prof-3",
        "provider": "openai",
        "name": "OpenAI Sandbox"
      }
    },
    "order": {
      "openai": [
        "prof-3",
        "prof-1"
      ],
      "anthropic": [
        "prof-2"
      ]
    }
  },
  "copiedProfileIds": [
    "prof-1",
    "prof-2",
    "prof-3"
  ],
  "skippedProfileIds": []
}
==================================================
```

